    'niche.avocats.title': 'Lawyers & legal professionals',
    'niche.avocats.desc': "Discover AI tools designed to support lawyers, legal advisors and law professionals in their daily work. Analyze contracts, summarize legal documents, conduct regulatory research, prepare arguments and automate administrative tasks. Save time while improving your organization and productivity.",
    'niche.marketing.title': 'Marketing & communication',
    'niche.marketing.desc': "Explore the AI tools transforming the work of marketing and communications professionals. Create advertising campaigns, write SEO-optimized content, generate social media posts, analyze performance and study consumer behavior. Grow your marketing strategy and improve your results.",
    'niche.multimedia.title': 'Video, audio & multimedia creation',
    'niche.multimedia.desc': "Discover AI solutions that make professional audiovisual content creation easier. Generate videos from text, create animations, produce natural-sounding voiceovers, transcribe audio recordings and improve sound quality. Edit videos faster, automate repetitive tasks and bring your creative ideas to life.",
    'niche.dev.title': 'Development & programming',
    'niche.dev.desc': "Access a selection of AI tools for developers, programmers and software engineers. Generate code, detect and fix errors, explain complex functions, automate testing and optimize your software projects. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced developer, discover assistants that speed up your work and make app building easier.",
    'niche.sante.title': 'Medicine & healthcare professionals',
    'niche.sante.desc': "Explore AI tools built to support doctors, nurses, researchers and other healthcare professionals. Make report writing easier, organize medical records, analyze scientific publications, transcribe consultations and automate administrative tasks. Discover solutions that support research, improve the organization of care and assist professionals in their practice — without replacing clinical judgment.",
