    'home.faq.title': "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
    'home.faq.sub': "The essential answers to browse Albexia with confidence.",
    'home.faq.submitLink': "Submit a tool",
    'home.faq.q1': "What is an Artificial Intelligence (AI) tool?",
    'home.faq.a1': "An AI tool is software or an application that uses advanced algorithms to perform tasks that previously required human intelligence. This includes text generation (such as ChatGPT), image creation (Midjourney), audio production (FineVoice) or data analysis. On Albexia, we list these tools to help you automate your work and boost your productivity.",
    'home.faq.q2': "Are the tools listed on Albexia free?",
    'home.faq.a2': "It depends on each tool. We sort tools into three clear categories: 100% Free, Freemium (free with limited features, then paid for advanced options) and Paid. On each sheet, we detail the exact prices and often tell you whether a free trial is available before you pay.",
    'home.faq.q3': "How do I choose the best AI tool for my work?",
    'home.faq.a3': "To make the right choice, start by identifying your main need (writing, design, SEO, social media management). Then use our \"Niches\" section to filter tools suited to your profession. Read our detailed reviews, compare features and check other users' feedback before subscribing.",
    'home.faq.q4': "Are the AI tools listed safe and reliable?",
    'home.faq.a4': "Yes. We manually check every submission before publishing a sheet. We make sure the tool is active, that its website is secure (HTTPS) and that it offers a legitimate service. However, as with any online service, we recommend always reading the tool's terms of use and privacy policy before sharing sensitive data.",
    'home.faq.q5': "How does Albexia make money? (Transparency)",
    'home.faq.a5': "Access to our directory is 100% free for you. To fund the site and keep testing new tools, we use affiliate links. This means that if you click a link to a tool (such as SE Ranking) and decide to subscribe, we may earn a small commission. This does not change the price you pay at all, but it greatly helps us keep the project alive.",
    'home.faq.q6': "I'm a creator, how do I add my tool to Albexia?",
    'home.faq.a6': "If you have developed an AI tool, submission is free. You can fill in the form directly from this home page, or go to the dedicated page \"{soumettre}\". Our team will review your request to create a complete sheet and present your solution to our audience.",
    'home.faq.q7': "How often are tool sheets updated?",
    'home.faq.a7': "The AI world evolves very fast. We update our sheets regularly to reflect new prices, new features or interface changes in the tools. If you spot an error on a sheet (a price that has changed, a broken link), don't hesitate to contact us so we can correct it immediately.",
    'home.showcaseSelection': 'AI selection',
