    'soumP.valueTitle': "To answer a question: why list your tool on Albexia?",
    'soumP.valueP1': "Albexia is a multilingual directory dedicated to artificial intelligence tools, designed to help individuals, entrepreneurs, content creators and professionals find solutions that fit their needs.",
    'soumP.valueP2': "Although its main language is French, Albexia is not limited to French speakers. The platform is aimed in particular at users in Haiti, Africa, the Caribbean, France and Quebec, while remaining accessible to English and Spanish-speaking communities.",
    'soumP.valueSub': "A presence in three languages",
    'soumP.valueP3': "Every tool listed on Albexia has its own listing in French, English and Spanish. These three versions are generated as separate static HTML pages, so the same tool can be reached by internet users in three different languages.",
    'soumP.valueP4': "This approach increases the chances of appearing in search engine results, without guaranteeing any particular ranking or volume of traffic.",
