    'soumP.faqTitle': "Frequently asked questions",
    'soumP.faq1Q': "How do I list my tool?",
    'soumP.faq1A': "Fill in the form above with the URL, name, category, description and your email. Submitting is free.",
    'soumP.faq2Q': "What is the difference between Free, Starter and Featured?",
    'soumP.faq2A': "Free: full listing for life, subject to review. Starter ($39, 6 months): verified badge, up to 3 blog articles linked to the listing and access to the tracking dashboard. Featured ($59, 12 months): homepage spotlight, newsletter mention, up to 5 articles and access to the tracking dashboard.",
    'soumP.faq3Q': "How is payment made?",
    'soumP.faq3A': "Starter and Featured are paid once, by Visa or Mastercard card, in US dollars. There is no automatic renewal charge.",
